- Step 3: Imported and integrated `LoadingOverlay` into the main `Home` component in `src/app/page.tsx`, controlled by the `isSearching` state.
- Step 4: Manually verified the logic and styles.
- Step 5: Fixed mobile zoom and layout issues by adding viewport settings and increasing font size.
- Step 6: Updated preference options: renamed "自定义" to "其他" and added a conditional input field for custom categories.
- Step 7: Implemented a custom Toast notification system in `src/app/page.tsx` and replaced all native `alert` calls for a better user experience.
- Step 8: Enhanced scheme cards in `src/app/page.tsx` to display "偏爱朋友X" or "善待多人" green labels based on the favored friend tags.
- Step 9: Simplified scheme labels by removing "备选方案" and updating favoring text to "善待好朋友X".
- Step 11: Updated application title to "碰头！", added slogan "别多想了 见面重要", and changed the icon to 🤝.

